<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Budget no short term rates implications-RBA.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Budget no short term rates implications-RBA.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA) governor Bernie Fraser said on Thursday the Liberal-National government's 1996/97 budget, announced in August, had no short-term implications for interest rates.</p>
</text>
